<h1>Confirm Organization SSO</h1>

<p><%= Common.greeting(@username) %>,</p>

<p>
  Use this code to confirm connecting your Hex.pm account to single sign-on for the
  <strong><%= @organization %></strong> organization:
</p>

<p><strong><%= @code %></strong></p>

<p>
  This code expires in 10 minutes. It works only in the browser where the SSO sign-in began.
  If you did not request this, you can ignore this email.
</p>
